    "description": "Mapei India South Asia Partners is actively seeking a talented and motivated Process Engineer to join our dynamic team in Madurai. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Mapei India South Asia Partners:\nMapei India South Asia Partners is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Oversee daily production operations to meet output targets\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n• Implement lean manufacturing and continuous improvement initiatives\n• Ensure environmental compliance and waste management\n• Coordinate with logistics for dispatching finished goods\n• Monitor equipment performance and coordinate preventive maintenance\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 6-10 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n• Proficiency in TPM\n• Proficiency in Supply Chain Management\n• Proficiency in GD&T\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n• Proficiency in ISO 9001\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Referral bonus program\n• Flexible working hours\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Salary Range: 12 LPA - 25 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Madurai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Mapei India South Asia Partners!",
